      {
       "en": "[[pramatta-singha|Pramatta Singha]] built the brick [[rang-ghar|Rang Ghar]] at [[rangpur|Rangpur]] in 1746. Its two-storeyed pavilion allowed the court to watch public games and performances. The monument belongs to eighteenth-century Ahom architecture.",
